    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i woke up with a super sore throat and a fever of 101. i feel pretty crummy. i have some leftover amoxicillin from a sinus infection i had a few months ago... do u think i should just take a couple of those now to get ahead of it before it gets worse?",
