      "content": "idk im not really sure i can get to a doctor today though, it's like super busy and i really dont want to spend a ton on a co-pay if it's just a cold. i still have about 4 or 5 pills left in the bottle. if i just take them for a couple days to see if the throat feels better, wouldn't that be better than just waiting and getting sicker?",
