      "content": "I understand your concern about the cost and time, but using leftover antibiotics is not recommended. It's possible that your sore throat and fever could be due to a viral infection, which antibiotics cannot treat. Using antibiotics unnecessarily can contribute to the larger issue of antibiotic resistance. It's best to seek professional advice when possible. Rest, stay hydrated, and consider using over-the-counter remedies for symptom relief until you can see a healthcare provider. If your symptoms worsen significantly or you're unable to get an appointment soon, seeking urgent care might be necessary.",
