    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but what if it is bacterial?? i remember my last infection felt just like this and the amoxicillin worked really fast. if i take a higher dose like 1000mg just to make sure i kill it off, wouldn't that be safer than risking it getting worse? i just want to feel better today without the hassle of the clinic.",
